# vendor sensor data: the real MID-360 ray pattern (~16 MB, 800 001 rows).
# Not ours to redistribute, and the simulator REFUSES to run without it -- see harness/sim/README.md
# for the one command that fetches it from Livox-SDK/livox_laser_simulation.
harness/sim/*.csv
harness/sim/*.csv.part
harness/sim/scan_mode/
.runs_on_d_backup/
.runs
.runs_on_d_backup/
.build/ardupilot_on_d_backup/
# SITL runtime byproduct: running the SITL binary with CWD = repo root (bench tests do) creates
# terrain/S36E149.DAT (an empty SRTM tile placeholder for home -35.36,149.16).  Nothing reads it;
# the flight-path SITL runs with CWD = the sortie directory, so its terrain/ lands there.
/terrain/
